# HMUF02-V5 with the Wi-Fi lamp on the GREEN LED.
#
# The second population: same board name, same device tree, same three lamps,
# but the two colour LEDs are fitted the other way round.  Nothing in software
# distinguishes it -- the labels still say blue = Wi-Fi -- so the roles have to
# point at the other label.  Identify the unit by eye first:
#
#   led-probe --blink blue:wlan 3     # does the blue or the green LED light?
#
# and if the Wi-Fi lamp is green, apply this table.
#
# desc: HMUF02-V5, Wi-Fi on green, LTE on blue (the swapped population)
wifi	green:wan
wan	blue:wlan
wan_fault	red:power
